[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_APOCALYPSE]
Ending of the End

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_APOCALYPSE_desc]
The question is not whether, or how, or when, for that is our destiny. The question is who. Who will lead the conquest of Equestria world? King Sombra clearly has an answer to that question.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_APOCALYPSE]
终末的终焉

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_APOCALYPSE_desc]
问题不在于是否、如何、何时，因为那是我们的命运。问题在于谁。谁将领导对小马利亚世界的征服？森布拉大王对于这个问题显然已经有了答案。

